part wrzos_records
  tally 1
  note "Bank Wrzos statements of Ola's account: October 2024, February and March 2025, all she kept (story). A ';' CSV with decimal commas (O:B-1), written out whole. Each row day is a covering version known that day (the account is seen live); the days between rows are covered by a version known when the statement came (the 2nd of the next month, assumed)."

